  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BO Living Well Indicators</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this grant is to strengthen the Bolivian government&#x2019;s capacity to develop and implement a system of statistical indicators to measure well-being in a multidimensional sense (the Vivir Bien Indicators), which constitutes the basis of Bolivia&#x2019;s national development plan.</narrative>
  </description>
